{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfrzBUNWwDXRRnCvjN5EW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`get_metadata_for_wheel()` now reads exactly `{name}-{version}.dist-info/METADATA` from the wheel, so a vendored package's dist-info can no longer be picked up by mistake. The five test files I ran pass (76 passed, 2 skipped). I didn't run the full suite, mypy or the formatter: `.venv` has no `ruff`, so the new code is unformatted and unlinted.\n\n- **Helpers:** `src/fromager/pkgmetadata/pep376.py` adds `verbatim_dist_name()` and `dist_info_name()`, both exported from `fromager.pkgmetadata`. Both call `parse_wheel_filename` first, so bad names or non-wheel files raise `InvalidWheelFilename`. The name and version come straight from the filename text, so `MarkupSafe` keeps its case and the version isn't normalized.\n- **Metadata lookup:** `candidate.py` has the new `_wheel_metadata_path(url)`. It takes the last path segment of the URL, ignores the query string and fragment, and URL-decodes the filename. I added the decoding myself, since the requirements didn't ask for it. A missing member raises `ValueError`.\n- **Reuse:** `wheels.py` and `dependencies.py` now call `verbatim_dist_name()` in place of their own `split(\"-\", 1)[0]`.\n- **Tests:** the new `tests/test_pep376.py` covers:\n  - case-preserving names\n  - invalid filenames\n  - verbatim versions\n  - URL query and fragment handling\n  - a wheel with a vendored dist-info alongside the real one\n  - the missing-member `ValueError`\n\nThe files I ran were `test_pep376.py`, `test_pep658_support.py`, `test_wheels.py`, `test_dependencies.py` and `test_pkgmetadata.py`. I haven't committed anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4558,"cache_read_input_tokens":50777,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4558},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"29f9c443-fb5a-46a1-ac65-ceb0eae2a679","uuid":"0dbd2e6e-895d-496b-90ab-2598cf2b4c84","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:34:28.750Z","request_id":"req_011CfrzBTxTr2VkEGaCsmqUJ"}
